                  "fill": "#222220",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Wide window: a written answer",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "OSTN0",
                  "name": "Wide window: a written answer, real window",
                  "width": 987,
                  "height": 617,
                  "fill": {
                    "type": "image",
                    "enabled": true,
                    "url": "lesson-shape/r5-write-w.png",
                    "mode": "cover"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "v2ojWn",
              "name": "Wide rule",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "p1qVIN",
                  "name": "Caption",
                  "fill": "#222220",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Wide rule",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "TxPeB",
                  "name": "Note",
                  "fill": "#5C5A52",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "What you read stands at the left. What you answer stands at the right, resting on the writing row. The row never moves, so nothing jumps between a question, a chat and a wait.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "S0ZYyz",
          "name": "Reasoning",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "gap": 40,
          "padding": [
            0,
            48
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "M4MEV",
              "name": "Asking and chatting",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 8,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "r6MQ4",
                  "name": "Asking and chatting title",
                  "fill": "#222220",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Asking and chatting",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 26,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "h3gI8a",
                  "name": "Asking and chatting text",
                  "fill": "#5C5A52",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "You always type in the same row. With a question open, \"Ask Quigley\" sends your words as a side question and the question stays, shown small above the row. With nothing asked, the same row is the chat, and three things the teacher can do sit above it as keys.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "uFaHL",
              "name": "Clarity",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 8,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "hsVtl",
                  "name": "Clarity title",
                  "fill": "#222220",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Clarity",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 26,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Ev4P3",
                  "name": "Clarity text",
                  "fill": "#5C5A52",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "One thing is largest on every screen: what is asked of you. Each question carries one small tag saying its kind (Quiz, Prediction, Explain, Code). The main key always says what the press does: Submit answer, Next step, Done for today.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "R9y0kQ",
              "name": "My calls, say so to change",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 8,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "C9g5t",
                  "name": "My calls, say so to change title",
                  "fill": "#222220",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "My calls, say so to change",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 26,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "mKL7y",
                  "name": "My calls, say so to change text",
                  "fill": "#5C5A52",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The key reads \"Ask Quigley\" (the teacher's name), where today it reads \"Ask Teacher\". An answered question shrinks to one quiet line with your answer beside it. The lesson's end lists what was kept and what comes back later. The step line is a thin row of blocks.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "lkigG",
          "name": "How made",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "padding": [
            0,
            48
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "y7D31",
              "name": "How made text",
              "fill": "#5C5A52",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Made in the real window from a throwaway mock, with the real top bar and teacher strip. The code and history pictures rename the space in the top bar. Sizes: 645 by 943, 640 by 600 and 1440 by 900.",
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 22,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
